* Introduction
  This document is a synthetic stress test for the rust-norg parser.
  It contains deep heading nesting, many paragraphs with inline markup,
  nested lists, quotes, definitions, and code blocks.
  The *bold text*, /italic text/, and `inline verbatim` are used heavily here.
  We also test {https://example.com}[links] and [anchor] references throughout.
** Deep Nesting Section
   Paragraph with *multiple* /inline/ `modifiers` and {https://rust-lang.org}[Rust link].
   This tests the stage_3 inline parser with lots of attached modifiers.
*** Level Three Heading
    The /quick/ *brown* fox `jumps` over the *lazy* /dog/. Every word has markup.
