**** Back to Level Four
     @code rust
     fn factorial(n: u64) -> u64 {
         match n {
             0 => 1,
             _ => n * factorial(n - 1),
         }
     }

     fn main() {
         for i in 0..10 {
             println!("{}! = {}", i, factorial(i));
         }
     }
     @end

     Another paragraph after the code block.

     |example
     This is a *ranged* tag with /inline/ markup.
     It spans multiple lines.
     |end

     =macro.test param1 param2
     Content inside a macro tag with *bold* text.
     =end
*** Back to Level Three
    More paragraphs to increase document size.
    Each paragraph has *some* /inline/ `markup` to stress stage_3.
    The parser needs to handle {https://links.example.com}[many links] efficiently.

